                  <nc xml:id="m-4a3080da-f80d-4cd4-a5e7-ddf608959dbf" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-f44ba51f-95a5-414b-afbd-f3cb88e60609" facs="#m-cae5b325-44d6-4d05-addc-8afe18ca6f18" pname="c" oct="4" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-b9b099c9-0f5a-44aa-8e08-e5f178b7c300"><lg xml:id="m-a667b487-a80c-438f-9d26-17d3e3ed1522"><l xml:id="m-e7802a18-d896-46b2-ac01-d08898d5f408" facs="#m-583f6f69-fc0b-47ab-a029-8c4f0c7bfb31" label="ambiguous">1698</l><l xml:id="m-edf05c73-370e-402c-ba06-719a38428400" facs="#m-d509de8c-c4e8-4a98-bc8d-882c97ef1e71" label="ambiguous">october 21. 23- 24.</l><l xml:id="m-1f608868-9c20-4bd9-a044-3ab33f84bd7b" facs="#m-8c75f5ed-99db-4ebc-b913-588b11a17e94" label="lyrics-like">dempti-ónis pré-ti-um. 6. Te próna múndi máchina, Clé¬</l><l xml:id="m-e565ac4d-e637-4aac-891f-1008f0735f38" facs="#m-b19cee25-f0db-4466-8eab-d0fbcb64e286" label="lyrics-like">mens adóret Tríni-tas, Et nos nóvi per grá-ti-am, Nóvum</l><l xml:id="m-ac30fe61-f729-4cab-b820-a03810712f7e" facs="#m-eda3d4d7-0426-4a07-bb11-fba32be89d64" label="lyrics-like">canámus cánti-cum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-bcfde8bd-4ac2-4473-8904-dd83e0bd90ec" facs="#m-5d77b368-21ab-45f8-8a36-d461a09122ff" label="ambiguous">21.</l><l xml:id="m-c2edcb7c-4041-494c-87b2-4e49622248b0" facs="#m-4de70416-23d7-4f50-b4aa-61df0f99f7bc" label="ambiguous">St. Hilarion, Abbot.</l><l xml:id="m-17dbe9a7-a2a9-4edc-a8fe-b023fdf2acc0" facs="#m-6c3a6dce-ee3d-47c9-a4ab-8b2929cc9135" label="ambiguous">Comm.</l><l xml:id="m-1cd6ad57-0de1-4352-ad13-06061b5ae239" facs="#m-e36c7391-aa44-4bcb-b84d-ead094c81fe3" label="text-like">Mass. Os justi. p. 1206.</l><l xml:id="m-8a7432c2-8d85-4923-9412-eac30d8fc0d3" facs="#m-edee46fc-525c-4509-a129-ee73f3a66c31" label="text-like">Comm. of St. Ursula and her Companions, Virgins and Martyrs:</l><l xml:id="m-01b46e95-9b14-4574-83b2-91bd37b7163f" facs="#m-a2824e51-12eb-4844-b74d-5420b0f96341" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Loquébar. p. 1215, with Collect, Secret and Post. p. 1225.</l><l xml:id="m-0a500531-f388-4871-8445-642f29f77d33" facs="#m-24e8639e-5f81-4bd3-8712-d42b7e37494d" label="text-like">23. St. Anthony Mary Claret, Bishop and Conf. I class.</l><l xml:id="m-1e636f10-83c9-4cee-84f7-de52dd4c538c" facs="#m-b37ddebe-a148-4b94-808f-547a6f22c7ef" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Sacerdótes tui. p. 1186, except the Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-e962d46c-6d7a-4871-b1d0-59c08111bd4b" facs="#m-2e608ee0-eed7-4da2-ac1f-2cb41ce4fc78" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-06adb5ac-540a-4d7d-9f6f-7279c87a88fd" facs="#m-22240ffe-e6e8-412d-87b6-5f3900b064a3" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui beátum Antónium Ma-l familias collegisti : ! concéde, quaé¬</l><l xml:id="m-db4b0b44-70e0-4e4a-8314-dd72a3f82547" facs="#m-ded14667-5104-44d3-8d9d-fd953e13f31c" label="lyrics-like">Uriam Confessórem tuum atque! sumus; ut, eius dirigéntibus mónitis</l><l xml:id="m-d3e3d5ed-7d25-4fa0-87b2-107b7933f0a7" facs="#m-87399cdb-5472-40a0-bd0a-ab63db7e036f" label="lyrics-like">Pontificem, apostólicis virtútibus! ac suffragántibus méritis, “animá¬</l><l xml:id="m-d5ab244a-b177-461b-9840-33421efdaddc" facs="#m-17acb877-f6aa-44e7-b049-11aa19dff287" label="lyrics-like">sublimásti, et per eum novas in! rum salûtem quaérere júgiter stu¬</l><l xml:id="m-95e4d662-6482-4c79-8399-2b22a43c3aa7" facs="#m-ada8e4aa-dbca-43d5-ac8e-247e53e33bbc" label="lyrics-like">Ecclésia clericórum ac virginum! deámus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-7748d64e-0e47-4d86-a845-4db6daabb8c8" facs="#m-6ed1812f-273e-45f6-a069-1318b2165b75" label="ambiguous">24.</l><l xml:id="m-10921d8d-9189-4456-801a-75804b8fb85d" facs="#m-65f51565-d40d-40d9-9f1f-fc969ae6854b" label="text-like">St. Raphael the Archangel. Double Major.</l><l xml:id="m-e6c0b9fa-99c3-4e64-ac57-57783150be58" facs="#m-3e7cda68-9e80-4212-a2de-c313c814a635" label="text-like">At First Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-0715361e-2ce5-4008-8530-4cc64735c125" facs="#m-a0a71cc7-2b97-478c-ac43-c58a310a21fe" label="lyrics-like">All as at second Vespers, p. 170l, excent the fisth psalm, which is Laudáte</l><l xml:id="m-23ec13df-971e-42c4-b546-4231aa8410fc" facs="#m-e75f5d03-7bf9-4036-a8a6-98cc6eef9d0f" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum. 8. c. p. 168, and the Antiphon at Magnificat. Irthe second Vespers</l><l xml:id="m-a6be000f-4c0c-4351-b478-23ee7be6a477" facs="#m-7d9743fd-0f12-4d09-937d-2510cf5a09cd" label="lyrics-like">are not celebrated, thé Psalms at first Vespers are taken from second Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-b2643d0c-cfca-422d-ba26-8a7ce8739ddf" facs="#m-c8f41c59-5996-41e3-b787-522baec44fb5" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-f9210be4-0c6e-4a40-9b2a-dcfa94dbd1a7" facs="#m-174afe59-2e70-429a-a306-4b2696386e4f" label="ambiguous">Ant. 5. a</l><l xml:id="m-6f5b0569-7cac-4e45-92cf-44ee5b6b392c" facs="#m-1e17e65a-f435-4b34-9ef8-cced7cd326db" label="lyrics-like">sum “Rápha-el Ange-lus, qui ásto ante</l><l xml:id="m-7a581d77-7a57-4749-9cef-1d9e436712cf" facs="#m-98f58c64-c302-491f-8918-1ec391a8c3fd" label="ambiguous">A</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
